<figure class="scope-visual" aria-labelledby="scope-title"><div class="visual-kicker">Illustrated process · Hypothetical scenario</div><h2 id="scope-title">One intended rule. An unexpectedly broad plan.</h2><p class="visual-intro">Understand the scope before approving the deployment.</p><ol class="scope-steps"><li><span class="step-number">01</span><div><h3>Investigate the scope</h3><p>Confirm the environment, inputs, drift, and unapplied changes.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-number">02</span><div><h3>Review a saved plan</h3><p>Explain the proposed actions and their service impact.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-number">03</span><div><h3>Apply the approved artifact</h3><p>Tie approval to the specific plan that will execute.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-number">04</span><div><h3>Verify the service</h3><p>Check intended connectivity and that unwanted access stays blocked.</p></div></li></ol><figcaption>Resource count is a starting point. The proposed actions and affected services determine the risk. <a href="/images/terraform-unexpected-changes/review-process.png">Open the full-size illustration</a>.</figcaption></figure>

